  "causality_statement": "The analysis documents a sharp, coincident change in unemployment during the COVID-19 period. It cannot establish that COVID-19 alone caused the change. There is no counterfactual, no randomised variation, and no control group; lockdowns, survey disruption, migration, fiscal support and global demand changed at the same time. The before-and-after comparison is descriptive.",
